WoWFA_En[460551] = "When Demonbolt consumes a Demonic Core it inflicts impending doom upon the target, dealing $460555s1 Shadow damage to enemies within $460555a1 yds of its target after $460553d or when removed. Damage is reduced beyond $s2 targets.\n\nHand of Gul'dan reduces the duration of Doom by ${$s1/1000} sec."
