WoWFA_En[1214442] = "Periodic damage from $?a445465[Wither][Immolate] has a $s1% chance to fire a Demonfire bolt at $s3% increased effectiveness.\n\nIncinerate has a $s2% chance to fire a Demonfire bolt at $s3% increased effectiveness."
WoWFA_Data[1214442] = "آسیب دوره‌ای $?a445465[Wither][Immolate] 4% شانس دارد یک بولت Demonfire با اثربخشی 100% بیشتر شلیک کند.\n\nIncinerate 25% شانس دارد یک بولت Demonfire با اثربخشی 100% بیشتر شلیک کند."
WoWFA_En[1214467] = "Calls down a rain of hellfire upon your target, dealing ${$42223m1*8} Fire damage over $d to enemies in the area.\n\n|cFFFFFFFFThis spell is cast at your target.|r"
